docs {
  # Delete Test Plan

  Soft-deletes a test plan. Project associations in `TEST_PLAN_PROJECTS` are preserved for
  audit trail integrity. Requires `test_plan:delete` permission and Owner/Editor in a linked
  project.

  - `204 No Content` — deleted
  - `403 Forbidden` — missing permission or not Owner/Editor
  - `404 Not Found` — not found, already soft-deleted, or not a member
}
